 "source_instruction": "i would like a peach juice that is non gmo and gluten free.",
 "query": "Ugh, you won\u2019t believe the chaos I ran into on the walk over here! There was a tiny golden retriever puppy that slipped its harness right by the store entrance, zooming straight for the display of potted pansies by the door and knocking three whole pots over before its owner could catch up. The poor kid who was restocking the flower display laughed so hard they snort-laughed when the puppy stopped mid-zoom to lick a crumb of chocolate chip cookie off their shoe, too. I stopped to help scoop dirt back into the pots for a minute, and the puppy\u2019s owner gave me a crumpled coupon for 15% off any store item as a thank you, which was such a nice little surprise. Hey, I\u2019m grabbing stuff from the beverages section right now and need something gluten reduced, non-GMO, and also infused with cold-pressed yuzu for extra zing. Oh right, make sure the total doesn\u2019t go over that one, I don\u2019t want to blow my budget. I remember the last batch I picked had that weird aftertaste so I\u2019m being extra careful to check the labels closely this time. Can you pull up options that fit all that?",
